==Description==
'''Biologist Charm''' is an exclusive charm introduced in the [[Ducky Revenge Event]] as a reward for reaching Level 14 on the premium track. It had a cost of {{DuckyEggs|410}} ({{Robux|49}} during the Memorial Day 2025 Sale) or {{Robux|58}} to unlock it, with a total cost of {{DuckyEggs|2,460}} or {{Robux|830}} ({{Robux|699}} during the Memorial Day 2025 Sale).

==Appearance==
'''Biologist Charm''' appearance is based on the default [[Biologist]]. It has it planting a [[Sunflower]]. It plays a sound of a totem falling down with a duck quack in the background.

The color changes based on the player's username color, but appears orange in inventory preview.

